# Rose Griffon stack runtime environment: NAMES ONLY, no values (compose.yaml, infra/docker/README.md).
# Production file: /etc/rosegriffon/rosegriffon.env (root:ubuntu 0600 -> 0640 if compose runs as ubuntu).
# It merges /etc/aphrody/rg-core.env (core, cron) and /etc/rg/rg.env (website build + runtime).
# Paths and ports below are set by compose.yaml per service and need not appear here:
#   NIE_GAME_DIR NIE_MODEL_* RG_CORE_HOST RG_CORE_PORT RG_CORE_CRON RG_CORE_MODELES RG_MEDIA_ROOT
#   CDN_STATIC_ROOT ACHILLEA_BACKUP_DIR HOSTNAME PORT
# Multi-line values (GOOGLE_PRIVATE_KEY) must be double-quoted. Loopback URLs (REDIS_URL...)
# must use host.docker.internal instead of 127.0.0.1.

